      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جدّعهُ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَجْدِيعٌ</span>: see 1, in five places.
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَدَّعَهُ وَشَرَّاهُ</span> (tropical:) <i>He made him to experience evil
